### f001 auth-not-enforced: GET /admin/users

The auth-not-enforced rule.

Remediation: Fix auth-not-enforced.

Evidence: `GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/users` answered 200.

~~~~http
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer «redacted:bearerAuth_token»
~~~~

~~~~http
HTTP 200
content-type: text/plain

echo: authorization: Bearer «redacted:bearerAuth_token»
<script>alert(1)</script>
~~~~

Reproduce:

~~~~sh
curl 'http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/users' -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{bearerAuth_token}}'
~~~~

